#: ../../user/plugin-notification.md:135
msgid ""
"The associated record and variant types — `options`, `attachment`, "
"`action`, `actionType`, `pendingNotification`, `activeNotification`, "
"`channel`, `scheduleInterval`, `scheduleEvery`, and `removeActiveTarget` "
"— are all re-exported from `PluginNotification`. Per-field doc comments "
"and upstream URLs live in `packages/plugin-"
"notification/src/PluginNotification.resi`."
msgstr ""
"関連する record / variant 型 (`options`, `attachment`, `action`, "
"`actionType`, `pendingNotification`, `activeNotification`, `channel`, "
"`scheduleInterval`, `scheduleEvery`, `removeActiveTarget`) はすべて "
"`PluginNotification` から再エクスポートされています。各フィールドの doc "
"コメントと上流 URL は `packages/plugin-notification/src/PluginNotification.resi` "
"を参照してください。"

#: ../../user/plugin-notification.md:142
msgid "Schedule helpers"
msgstr "Schedule ヘルパー"

#: ../../user/plugin-notification.md:144
msgid "`Schedule.t` is an opaque type built through three factories:"
msgstr "`Schedule.t` は 3 つのファクトリ経由で生成する opaque 型です:"

#: ../../user/plugin-notification.md:157
msgid ""
"The recurrence kinds accepted by `Schedule.every` are `#year`, `#month`, "
"`#twoWeeks`, `#week`, `#day`, `#hour`, `#minute`, and `#second`. "
"`#second` is **not** supported on iOS upstream — see [Schedule.every "
"reference](https://v2.tauri.app/reference/javascript/notification/#scheduleevery)."
msgstr ""
"`Schedule.every` が受け付ける繰り返し種別は `#year` / `#month` / `#twoWeeks` / "
"`#week` / `#day` / `#hour` / `#minute` / `#second` です。`#second` は "
"上流の iOS では **サポートされていません** — [Schedule.every リファレンス]"
"(https://v2.tauri.app/reference/javascript/notification/#scheduleevery) "
"を参照してください。"

#: ../../user/plugin-notification.md:162
msgid ""
"`scheduleInterval` follows upstream's `1=Sunday … 7=Saturday` convention "
"for the `weekday` field."
msgstr ""
"`scheduleInterval` の `weekday` フィールドは上流の規約 "
"`1=Sunday … 7=Saturday` に従います。"

